  "source": "All six stages finished. The LinkedIn draft still wasn’t ready to publish.

Studio’s notes describe 25 review findings in that draft. The source was one commit title plus attribution, but the generated copy added claims about privacy settings and audit trails that the evidence did not support. A manual correction removed the unsupported copy and remained unapproved. The documented check recorded no new publication.

The drafting instructions were revised, and the reviewed change passed 845 offline tests. The tests checked how prompts were put together and responses processed. They did not establish whether a future AI-written post would be accurate or useful.

Source: GitHub repository anit0607/ai-journey-studio, commit `e2a608b9f7a9e1dfde4f96709e8cb47a182819ff`, documented 25 October 2026"
